# See https://help.github.com/articles/ignoring-files/ for more about ignoring files.

# dependencies
/node_modules
/.pnp
.pnp.*
.yarn/*
!.yarn/patches
!.yarn/plugins
!.yarn/releases
!.yarn/versions

# testing
/coverage

# QA artifacts (screenshots / reports produced by .qa/*.mjs)。它们属于**本机一次运行的产物**，
# 不是源码：docs 里写明 `.qa/out` 不共享、不进仓。
/.qa/out/

# playwright
/test-results/
/playwright-report/
# Playwright browser store + its .links marker. The marker records an ABSOLUTE
# machine path, so committing it leaks a local path into a template repo that is
# copied for every new prototype. Browsers resolve from the default cache.
/.playwright-browsers/

# next.js
/.next/
/out/

# production
/build

# misc
.DS_Store
*.pem

# debug
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.pnpm-debug.log*

# env files (can opt-in for committing if needed)
.env*

# vercel
.vercel

# typescript
*.tsbuildinfo
next-env.d.ts
